# config/

Boot-time configuration for ${PROJECT_NAME}. Fail-fast on bad config.

| File | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`env.ts`](env.ts) | Zod-validated env loader. Reads `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` and falls back to `app.json`'s `extra`. |
| [`queryClient.ts`](queryClient.ts) | Singleton `QueryClient` for TanStack Query. Tuned for mobile defaults. |

## What does NOT live here

- Screen components (those live in `screens/`).
- API clients (those live in `api/`).
- Type definitions shared across folders (those live in `types/`).

